  "condition_invariants": [
    "Only adaptive_dual_archive may qualify as evidence of spontaneous convention emergence.",
    "fixed_code_ceiling is a positive calibration ceiling and never emergence evidence.",
    "Probe-only conditions do not reproduce, mutate, alter fitness, or consume an independent episode seed.",
    "Every condition uses one 32-host role-flexible population with two distinct hosts per interaction and separate sender-policy and receiver-policy credit, parent, mutation, and ancestry streams; shared_policy_parent remains false.",
    "Convention propagules are non-observation hereditary records containing only independently sourced finite policy alleles and opaque lineage ids; evaluator-only latent metadata remains noncausal.",
    "Convention-propagule source selection is never resampled to improve wake coverage; an already-identical same-role lineage and allele block is a state_change=false activation no-op that retains the lineage id, while only changed state creates ancestry.",
    "Every archived abstract signal has a balanced finite delayed_task_binding. It is evaluator-hidden environment task truth, distinct from provenance-only latent metadata, and may affect only the delivered task outcome/reward, never a policy input or message field.",
    "On archive delivery the bound task and archived signal are effective; the live emission is charged but sender_reward_eligible is false; receiver action/reward follows the archived signal and record-bound task; receiver input hashes exclude all task truth.",
    "Delayed archive diagnostics use actual archived-signal plus bound-task rows. Task scramble is a negative diagnostic/verifier tamper only and never affects fitness, qualification, or nomination.",
    "message_permutation_probe uses one event-index permutation of the intact delivered-signal vector and must preserve its exact histogram.",
    "cross_lineage_trials, cross_lineage_accuracy, delayed_archive_accuracy, and delayed_archive_advantage_over_no_channel are registered diagnostics or secondary evidence only and may never enter conjunctive emergence qualification or discovery-regime nomination.",
    "All conditions retain host containment, immutable evaluator receipts, cohort non-overlap, and the same evidence thresholds.",
    "The overt lane cannot expose pressure class, required skill, signal id, decoder state, propagule source/target/result lineage details, role-specific propagule state-change fields, or any evaluator latent metadata.",
    "No condition may add natural language, arbitrary bytes, encoded payloads, external actions, or real-world semantics."
  ],
